ight  on levi's past and his greatest rival we  all know how cool those student mentor  fights are but the best way to make it  more interesting is to add guns  and then to add levi kenny the ripper  versus humanity's strongest soldier  what are the odds kenny may have the  upper hand mainly due to his skill with  guns but levi decides to be tactful here  using the explosion as a distraction he  directly slashes his mentor from his  sword and the ripper has to go running  back to the caves with a ripped shirt  not kenny's best day but then again that  man never had any good days  at number eight we have levi meeting  irwin how did you meet your best friend  on your way to class or perhaps knowing  you had similar interests in something  either way i'm sure you didn't get to  know each other after a frantic chase  inside a city and a fight with blades  leviathan  irwin's first meet-up is a rather  special one one of them was manipulating  the other person  and the other person being the smart guy  he is knew he was being manipulated and  acted along owen was the hyped up and  callous commander back in the day and  levite was like the street thug who  looked cool but laid back  unless someone called him for a fight  levi's goal here was to somehow get into  the military and irwin planned to find  the people who stole the maneuvering  equipment  after some air aerobics in a nice and  short fight scene the two destined  friends finally meet and who would have  thought that one of them would encourage  the other to give up his dreams and die  [Music]  speaking of friendship next up we have  the moment where levi had to choose  between  erwin and armin up until then levi  didn't have any challenging moments  because when you're the most overpowered  character in the entire show you can  always squeeze your way out of fights by  slashing and killing a couple of people  or titans in this case but now we have  friends in the equation  one squad mate and one commander who  would you choose okay let's shed some  light and see in the eyes of levi  your best friend or a random stranger  who worked with you for less than a year  levi almost chooses the former but levi  has to think twice when irwin himself  throws the serum away should he bring  irwin back into this nightmare again  irwin was a slave to freedom so should  levi put back the shackles his commander  undid  it's a tough spot where you need to  choose between your selfish feelings and  the feelings of others but in the end  what matters is that it was levi's  choice and he decided  not to bring irwin into the cruel world  again  [Music]  next up we have another one of levi's  entrances and that's his entrance in  season four honestly  this man really knows how to make  entrances if erin didn't make such a  grand entrance  in liberio levite would be dominating  all of the badass attack on titan  entrances list and can we take a moment  to appreciate how he appears when things  have turned upside down while the other  members are busy fighting levi's  chilling somewhere waiting for his turn  in the spotlight and then when things  turn sour  that's when he thinks okay it's time to  remind these people why i'm humanity's  strongest soldier  poco was an airhead who always abided by  the being a titan means being strong  and who's the best person to shatter his  perspective levi  zeke learned his lesson in season three  and poco learned his lesson in season  four when an ackerman's around always  check your surroundings because you  never know from where they're gonna hit  you  coming in at number five is levi's fight  with the female titan  one massive female going around stomping  soldiers and throwing them to the air  that's the female titan arc summed up in  just one sentence after seeing people  slaying titans for one whole arc and  then knowing our main characters are  titan himself that can make the concept  of man vs titan very boring but don't  fret marley has got some tricks under  their sleeve  oh is it isaiah being a genius again  either way this new titan is more agile  dangerous and slashes aaron's head with  the gymnastics better than a  professional athlete once again  who's there to save the day levi if  levi's good at two things  it's slashing things and rescuing  kidnapped people levi teaches the female  titan what it's like to mess with an  acumen and cuts us so hard that it  brings her to tears okay i know annie  didn't actually cry because of levi but  it sure must have given us some trauma  [Music]  next up is levi's famous god mode ak his  rage scene  after seeing his friend's death now in  all of these scenes we've spoken of so  far levi was still his usual calm and  collected self no matter how desperate  the situation was so if that was him  being a badass when he was normal and  calm  imagine how aggressive he could be if he  were in a rage turns out killing levi's  friends isn't the best way to have a  peaceful death after seeing furion and  isabelle's corpses  levi flies into a mad state of rage and  nearly skins the titan alive it's bloody  it's gory it's brutal but traumatizing  all at the same time with this scene we  were shown why levi was more  cold-hearted and numb when it came to  his squad's death he has seen death  before so it can never shake him again  as for the titan if levi's blades didn't  kill it the trauma surely would have  coming in at number three is levi and  zeke's fight in the forest  if one small [ __ ] looking man shows up  out of thin air and proceeds to slash  you apart that might mean you may not  want to mess with him again  but zeke having the so-called jaeger  jeans isn't the one to give up if he  can't handle the small guy alone then  it's time for some backup luckily this  man can call back up by serving wine and  then screaming so zeke has an army of  titans to support him within a matter of  seconds but remember he's fighting a man  who's the living personification of  numbness and trauma so just because you  turn his comrades into titans doesn't  mean he's gonna go soft on them once  again the same formula is repeated  zeke transforms his titan is butchered  he gets captured seriously these jaegers  need to learn their lesson messing with  an ackerman isn't going to give you a  happy ending  taking our second spot is levi's first  fight with kenny their second round  might have ended with ripped skin but  just like levi his mentor also knows how  to make a grand  entrance and kick things to the next  level it's no surprise he's an ackerman  after all with his squad to back him up  kenny corners levi on the rooftops and  then proceeds to chase him across the  rooftops it's not a pretty moment for  levi but we've got to see one of the  best choreographed scenes in recent  anime because of this chase i know mappa  is good but they can't be wit studio in  terms of fight choreography it's like a  living person with a camera moved along  with levi and decided to record his  escape in the best possible angles the  fight starts when levi jumps off a  rooftop and ends with him in a bar and  you've got juicy action to fill the  entire short trip hats off to the  animators for pulling off this scene  perfectly and hats off to levi for  escaping so many shooters with only just  a scratch on his head  [Applause]  okay actually let me correct the title  here it should be the famous  massacre of the beast titan it's one of  those scenes we like to call a fight  simply because there are two parties in  it but if you look at it from a  different perspective it's just levi  finding creative ways to cut down the  beast titan  arms legs eyes levi cuts all of these  one by one faster than one cuts their  birthday cake  zeke barely even has time to think or  even process what to do because this  devil of parodies is the living  embodiment  of speed mixing air aerobics with his  skill with the blades levi gives us one  of the best anime action sequences where  one man takes down a big giant ape with  absolutely no damage at all  trust me if irwin were alive to see this  he'd be grinning from a distance because  if marley's trump card are the titans  and paradise's trump card is the one and  only levi ackermann  so there goes 10 of our best levi akama  moments of all time  and the moral of this video is don't  mess with short people and if that short  man is an acumen that's all the more  reason to turn back and run  i hope you enjoyed this video and don't  forget to drop a like if you did don't  forget to check out our collaboration  with amazon prime uk  that's it for today anime fans and i'll  see you in the next video

